cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software as shown below."
title: "FDE: Fast-Deployment Ensemble for imbalanced tabular classification"
abstract: >-
  FDE builds a heterogeneous ensemble around the best tuned single learner, routes datasets by their class ratio,
  and removes members in order of a fixed prediction-cost table while the out-of-fold score of the full member set is
  kept, so that the deployed ensemble predicts fast.
